Error [E0072]: This collecting loop cannot return a List because it has no finite exhaustion edge
  --> tests/ui/yielding_loop_nonfinite.jet:2:15
    |
  2 |     values :: loop -> 1
    |               ^^^^
 Why: A collecting loop must finish after a statically finite source or C-style condition; bare infinite and condition-only loops do not provide that boundary
 Fix: Remove `->`, or iterate a finite source; return one final value from an ordinary loop with `break value`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0072
